  "ruleText": "Lab 1601.01 Statement of Purpose. This chapter sets forth the procedures and forms for carrying out the provisions of RSA 281-A:42-aa pertaining to the workers’ compensation appeals advisory board.\n\nSource. #8527, eff 12-22-05, EXPIRED: 12-22-13\n\nNew. #10959, eff 10-23-15; ss by #14489, eff 1-22-26; EXPIRES: 1-22-36",
